And don't be too picky in what you keep, especially spellbooks and wands.
After all, every time you polymorph one of those, their "recharge counter"
gets increased by one. Polymorph a wand three times and you won't be able
to recharge it reliably anymore. Better a wand of cold (2:5) than a wand
of death (6:0).

